      "text": "WHEREAS, the following factors, among others, affect the degree of integration: the site selected for housing or for schools; the distribution of information as to the availability of housing especially among minority group organizations, the coordination of a particular housing plan or project with other housing in a particular area or neighborhood; and the availability of rent subsidies or other similar programs,",
